self and grow 2 meters taller<br /> than its original form, the skin will be peeled off and muscle tissues will get black pigment. The possessed body will afterwords roam around the accessible areas slaughtering<br /> everything in its peripheral vision. SCP 5127-2 possesses incredible strength and resistance to bullets. Once the period between 6-7 hours passes or the possessed body is taken<br /> down it will leave the deceased person's body and go back in SCP 5127-1.<br /> Notes: Following the event of ████████ SCP 5127-2 will now attempt to possess bodies that are being resurrected for 1st time.</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/velja-vraccarevicc" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6524034&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605818658" alt="Velja Vraccarevicc" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6524034)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/velja-vraccarevicc" >Velja Vraccarevicc</a></span></p> 
