					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5156-investigation-001</guid>
				<title>SCP-5156 Investigation 001</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5156-investigation-001</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Date:&lt;/strong&gt; November 13th, 2019.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; ████████, USA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personnel Present:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Senior Agent ████████, Intelligence Agency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operative Mark █████, Codename &amp;quot;Plague&amp;quot;, Mobile Task Force &amp;quot;See No Evil&amp;quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Head Task Force Sergeant ███████, Codename &amp;quot;Death&amp;quot;, Mobile Task Force &amp;quot;See No Evil&amp;quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operative Dwayne █████, Codename &amp;quot;Striker&amp;quot;, Mobile Task Force &amp;quot;See No Evil&amp;quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Task Force Sergeant ███████, Codename &amp;quot;Swift&amp;quot;, Mobile Task Force &amp;quot;See No Evil&amp;quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elite Operative Jonathan █████, Codename &amp;quot;Vector&amp;quot;, Mobile Task Force &amp;quot;See No Evil&amp;quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investigation Start&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Death&amp;quot;: Hold! I think I see the Anomaly. Alright, Vector go and check it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Vector&amp;quot;: On it boss. I think it sees me. I&#039;ll go closer&amp;#8212;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anomaly stabs through Vector&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Death&amp;quot;: Holy sh- OPEN FIRE!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;em&gt;Gunfire Continues&lt;/em&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Striker&amp;quot;: Sir, I don&#039;t think this is doing anything to it!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Death&amp;quot;: Screw it, halt your fire. We have to contain it in here somehow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Plague&amp;quot;: But wouldn&#039;t that attract attention from the public?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Death&amp;quot;: Listen here, Vector just Fng died. I can&#039;t afford to lose more men. We&#039;ll hold him here until backup arrives to contain him. We will cover this thing up to the media somehow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Plague&amp;quot;: Copy that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Striker&amp;quot;: Where the hell is Swift?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Plague&amp;quot;: Unsure, he must&#039;ve bailed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Striker&amp;quot;: Ppsh, coward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Death&amp;quot;: Alright, backup is here. Let&#039;s get this over with.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;em&gt;Intense containment action continues&lt;/em&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Debrief Log Start&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Senior Agent: Alright, Mr. █████. Now tell me, what happened in your approach to said Anomaly?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Death&amp;quot;: While approaching the entity, █████ died. We fired up almost all of our bullets, it did almost nothing to it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Senior Agent: I see, and what did the Anomaly look like? What were it characteristics?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Death&amp;quot;: It looked humanoid, genderless, and having no clothes and genitalia. It bled, but not for long. It recovers from bullet wounds as if it was nothing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Senior Agent: Alright, that&#039;s all I needed to know. Thank you for your time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alexei-molkov&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7031295&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1605818659&quot; alt=&quot;Alexei Molkov&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7031295)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alexei-molkov&quot;  &gt;Alexei Molkov&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2020 09:01:26 +0000</pubDate>
												<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <p><strong>Date:</strong> November 13th, 2019.</p> <p><strong>Location:</strong> ████████, USA.</p> <p><strong>Personnel Present:</strong></p> <p>Senior Agent ████████, Intelligence Agency.</p> <p>Operative Mark █████, Codename &quot;Plague&quot;, Mobile Task Force &quot;See No Evil&quot;.</p> <p>Head Task Force Sergeant ███████, Codename &quot;Death&quot;, Mobile Task Force &quot;See No Evil&quot;.</p> <p>Operative Dwayne █████, Codename &quot;Striker&quot;, Mobile Task Force &quot;See No Evil&quot;.</p> <p>Task Force Sergeant ███████, Codename &quot;Swift&quot;, Mobile Task Force &quot;See No Evil&quot;.</p> <p>Elite Operative Jonathan █████, Codename &quot;Vector&quot;, Mobile Task Force &quot;See No Evil&quot;.</p> <p>&lt;<em><strong>Investigation Start</strong></em>&gt;</p> <p>&quot;Death&quot;: Hold! I think I see the Anomaly. Alright, Vector go and check it.</p> <p>&quot;Vector&quot;: On it boss. I think it sees me. I'll go closer&#8212;.</p> <p>&lt;<em><strong>Anomaly stabs through Vector</strong></em>&gt;</p> <p>&quot;Death&quot;: Holy sh- OPEN FIRE!</p> <p>&lt;<em>Gunfire Continues</em>&gt;</p> <p>&quot;Striker&quot;: Sir, I don't think this is doing anything to it!</p> <p>&quot;Death&quot;: Screw it, halt your fire. We have to contain it in here somehow.</p> <p>&quot;Plague&quot;: But wouldn't that attract attention from the public?</p> <p>&quot;Death&quot;: Listen here, Vector just Fng died. I can't afford to lose more men. We'll hold him here until backup arrives to contain him. We will cover this thing up to the media somehow.</p> <p>&quot;Plague&quot;: Copy that.</p> <p>&quot;Striker&quot;: Where the hell is Swift?</p> <p>&quot;Plague&quot;: Unsure, he must've bailed.</p> <p>&quot;Striker&quot;: Ppsh, coward.</p> <p>&quot;Death&quot;: Alright, backup is here. Let's get this over with.</p> <p>&lt;<em>Intense containment action continues</em>&gt;</p> <p>&lt;<em><strong>Debrief Log Start</strong></em>&gt;</p> <p>Senior Agent: Alright, Mr. █████. Now tell me, what happened in your approach to said Anomaly?</p> <p>&quot;Death&quot;: While approaching the entity, █████ died. We fired up almost all of our bullets, it did almost nothing to it.</p> <p>Senior Agent: I see, and what did the Anomaly look like? What were it characteristics?</p> <p>&quot;Death&quot;: It looked humanoid, genderless, and having no clothes and genitalia. It bled, but not for long. It recovers from bullet wounds as if it was nothing.</p> <p>Senior Agent: Alright, that's all I needed to know. Thank you for your time.</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alexei-molkov" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7031295&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605818659" alt="Alexei Molkov" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7031295)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alexei-molkov" >Alexei Molkov</a></span></p> 
				 	]]>
