&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4b0082&quot;&gt;SOPHROSYNE CONTINUATION PROTOCOLS INITIATED SUCCESSFULLY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: darkred&quot;&gt;Alpha Priority Update&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;20 Feb. 2018:&lt;/strong&gt; Protocol Plain Sight is hindering our efforts to infiltrate the Morgellons team of the International Lyme and Associated Diseases Society. It is once again my recommendation that we implement some degree of Blacklight operation; these people are persistent, and are within ~5 years of discovery.&lt;br /&gt;
- &lt;span class=&quot;hover&quot;&gt;M. Leitao&lt;span style=&quot;color:#0645AD;&quot;&gt;Field Agent Mary Leitao, c/o &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/secure-facility-dossier-site-64&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Cameron Miles, Asst. Director of Personnel&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;span class=&quot;wiki-email&quot;&gt;snf.46-LPROSU|selim.c#snf.46-LPROSU|selim.c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, Executive Operator 7.24/Sophron-3, Field.&lt;/p&gt;
