&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-527664-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. Multiderm, &lt;span class=&quot;hover&quot;&gt;Department of Materials&lt;span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;wiki-email&quot;&gt;snf.smd|tseuqerofni#snf.smd|tseuqerofni&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; catalogue #FINS-1342.801.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-527664-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC3266263/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&amp;quot;Clinical, Epidemiologic, Histopathologic and Molecular Features of an Unexplained Dermopathy.&amp;quot;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-527664-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. SCP-007 infiltrates the enteric astroglial cells, extending the neural complexes into the spleen and macrophage systems, as well as making discrete connections to the enteric nervous system by way of the amalgamated astroglia.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-527664-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. ~48 years within the temporal dilation effect of 2400-A.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
