&lt;div class=&quot;danger-diamond&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/classification-committee-memo&quot;&gt;link to memo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;arrows&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;octagon&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;quadrants&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;top-quad&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;right-quad&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;left-quad&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;bottom-quad&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;top-icon&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;right-icon&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;left-icon&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;bottom-icon&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; All three instances of SCP-5083 currently inhabit the former Site-97, considered its effective containment zone at the moment. The area has been subjected to great temporal and spatial restructuring; no personnel are advised to enter the confines of the site under any circumstances. The area emits high levels of gamma radiation, however surrounding infrastructure and plant-life do not appear to be effected by the excess amounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On 12/02/2017, all personnel within the site have been abruptly removed from the area via anomalous means. All other SCPs secured within the former site have been deemed “neutralized”. Due to Site-97’s close proximity to civilian population, a large, reinforced wall has been constructed around the area without any complications. On-site nuclear weapons are to be remotely detonated in the event that the SCP-5083 instances attempt to expand their domain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5083 describes the collective designation of three humanoid entities, each possessing individual strengths and anomalous properties.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5083-1 is a tanned, humanoid male, roughly 2.2&amp;#160;m in height and 245&amp;#160;kg in weight. Subject possesses great strength, and appears extremely muscular. SCP-5083-1 is often very hateful and rude towards staff. DNA testing has proven SCP-5083-1 to be over 200 years of age. When questioned about its origin, SCP-5083-1 will get highly defensive and extremely violent, often attempting to escape containment and harm personnel in a rage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5083-2 is a semi-corporeal, dark black, humanoid entity, manifesting as a young male, looking to be between the ages of 15-17. Due to its physical nature, DNA testing is impossible to be conducted on SCP-5083-2. Subject is normally passive, yet very uncooperative with staff.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5083-2 is believed to be responsible for the abrupt restructuring of Site-97 due to its anomalous ability to manipulate the physical reality within a substantial range, allowing it a limited, yet very potent control over the temporal and physical dimensions of the immediate space surrounding it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5083-3 appears as a slim, humanoid female, roughly 165&amp;#160;cm in height and 50&amp;#160;kg in weight. Subject’s eyes and hair are entirely black- its hair measuring over 3&amp;#160;m in length. SCP-5083-3 possesses great strength, though has not proven to be stronger than SCP-5083-1.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5083-3 normally emits small forms of gamma radiation, however is able to concentrate it, using the dense flow to weaken surrounding infrastructure or harm personnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On 02/09/2017, all three SCP-5083 instances have been noticed by security personnel around the confines of Site-97. The entities were reported to be standing in front of the gate, willfully following personnel into the site, where they would stay contained for the next 10 months without much incidents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;SCP-5083 Recovered Interview Log&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewed:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5083-1, SCP-5083-2, SCP-5083-3&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewer:&lt;/strong&gt; Researcher-███&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foreword:&lt;/strong&gt; All three instances have been brought within Site-97’s interview room without facing any resistance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;Begin Log, Date: 12/02/2017&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Researcher-███:&lt;/strong&gt; Hello SCP-5083 instances. My name is Researcher-███ and I would like to get to know-.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5083-1:&lt;/strong&gt; [Interrupting] Hoi! Will you [exploitive] already?!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5083-3:&lt;/strong&gt; What is wrong with you?! Let it speak to us, we will be done with them soon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Researcher-███:&lt;/strong&gt; As I was saying, I would like to get to know you better. Could you please start off by telling us about your individual properties?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5083-2:&lt;/strong&gt; I apologize for my brother’s behavior. He is feeling quite fatigued and is easily irritated.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Researcher-███:&lt;/strong&gt; Can we&amp;#8230; please get back to the-&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5083-2:&lt;/strong&gt; [interrupting] Unfortunately, Researcher-███, we are afraid that we may be unable to answer your questions. Right now, we must get to work. The other anomalies contained within this facility are marvelous. We promise to care for them and watch over them, as you would have. Stay safe!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5083-1:&lt;/strong&gt; Heh- get to work then, brother. Get those fuckers outta here. We will begin the tests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;[SCP-5083-3: Laughs maniacally then instantly vanishes]&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Researcher-███:&lt;/strong&gt; What are you-&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;[SCP-5083-2 raises its arms to which Researcher-███ and all personnel within Site-97 begin to abruptly levitate and instantly reappear approximately 1km away from the site. Personnel report seeing the buildings apparently fold in on each other, some growing to twice its original size, whilst others split into separate units.]&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;End Log&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closing Statement:&lt;/strong&gt; [The 05 council has been notified of the infestation, and all personnel involved with the event have been subjected to immediate physical examination. Due to the structural instability and high traces of radiation present within Site-97, area is to be considered effectively “lost”. No recovery missions are to be conducted at the moment.]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footer-wikiwalk-nav&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#171; &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5082&quot;&gt;SCP-5082&lt;/a&gt; | SCP-5083 | &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5084&quot;&gt;SCP-5084&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#187;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/researcher-jason&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7013584&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1605818660&quot; alt=&quot;Researcher Jason&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7013584)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/researcher-jason&quot;  &gt;Researcher Jason&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
